# Keep the build context small and readable.
#
# data/ matters most: it holds the Postgres data directory (root-owned, so the
# daemon cannot even stat it and the build fails outright) and the ~500MB
# Scryfall bulk mirror. Neither belongs in an image layer.
data/

node_modules/
.next/
out/

.git/
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The real collection scans, if any are sitting here.
db/seed/collection-batch-*
db/seed/*-card-index.html

README.md
*.md

# Claude Code's working directory. .claude/worktrees/ in particular holds a
# full checkout of this repo per parallel agent, which would otherwise be
# copied into the build context by the Dockerfile's `COPY . .`.
.claude/
